    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everlords is a small strategy-god game where you build the map as you play. Place resources, create choke points, defend your base, and try to destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the powers of a demi-god to reshape the remnants of the dying lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to create new terrains: place resources with care, form choke points, leave space for settlements to expand, and gather Ether to enhance your powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, not everything you create will be benevolent. At times, the world you shape may harbor new dangers and unforeseen challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> Create new lands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your followers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everlords is a small strategy-god game where you build the map as you play. Place resources, create choke points, defend your base, and try to destroy your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the powers of a demi-god to reshape the remnants of the dying lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your ability to create new terrains: place resources with care, form choke points, leave space for settlements to expand, and gather Ether to enhance your powers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, not everything you create will be benevolent. At times, the world you shape may harbor new dangers and unforeseen challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <br> Create new lands</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/f335ea9fd248ede5dca5b54c82e1407b.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Grow your settlement</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/6c8ae1fe8a677920164094b4aa11af99.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your followers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.poster.avif?t=1737620687\" width=616 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.webm?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2818380/extras/58e72ec58b049317b756cdcb30d975b3.mp4?t=1737620687\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
